Scope: MVP with five templates, the analyzer, the vault, and export.

Work breakdown and timeline (example 6 weeks):

Week	Milestone	Deliverables
1	Ideation + requirements	Problem statement, personas, SRS
2	Design	Wireframes, architecture, data model
3	Core UI	Builder form, editor canvas, tabs
4	Features	Vault, analyzer, export/print
5	Testing + fixes	Test report, bug fixes
6	Docs + demo	User guide, API docs, demo script

Project structure:

legalease/
├── ai_core/generator.py     # prompts + Gemini calls
├── legalEaseAPI/main.py     # FastAPI endpoints
├── frontend/app.py          # Streamlit UI
├── web/index.html           # this prototype
├── .env                     # GEMINI_API_KEY (never committed)
└── requirements.txt

Risk register:

Risk	Impact	Mitigation
Hallucinated or incorrect clauses	High	Attorney-review disclaimer, human editing, curated templates
API key leakage	High	Backend proxy, .env, never ship keys in HTML
Data privacy	High	Avoid storing on servers, add encryption and consent
Scope creep	Medium	Freeze MVP scope, defer e-sign
API latency/cost	Medium	Streaming, caching, Flash-tier model
